QuestGuidance.Register("en",375,{
[11969]="700033FE\n1\tBring the stone-fragments to Tobold Leafcutter\030Collect stone-fragments (total: 3)\tThe Dead Spire lies due south of the northern entrance to the Barrow-downs. Tobold Leafcutter waits for you between the Barrow-downs and the Old Forest. Tobold Leafcutter wants you to gather rune-marked stone-fragments from near the Dead Spire, then return to him.\n",
[11970]="7006687F\n1\tDefeat the Ruthless Dead at Fennas Dûr (0/8)\tThe Ruthless Dead can be found at Fennas Dûr in the Blackroot Vale.\n2\tDefeat the Ruthless Dead at Fennas Dûr (total: 8)\tThe Ruthless Dead can be found at Fennas Dûr in the Blackroot Vale. You have discovered the Ruthless Dead at Fennas Dûr. You should defeat or inconvenience them and keep safe the people of the Blackroot Vale.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the Ruthless Dead at Fennas Dûr.\n",
[11971]="700668D8\n1\tTalk to Uidor\tUidor can be found in Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale. Sarnir informed you that Egnir intended to meet with Ludhír, another bowman of the Blackroot Vale. You should return to Uidor and learn where Ludhír might be found.\n2\tTalk to Ludhír\tLudhír can be found along the road to the north of Morlad that leads to Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale. Uidor informed you that Ludhír patrols the road leading to Fennas Dûr and the Paths of the Dead. You should seek out Ludhír and see if Egnir is with him.\n3\tFind Egnir near Fennas Dûr\tEgnir can be found near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale. Ludhír informed you that Egnir has gone to Fennas Dûr to confront the Ruthless Dead. You should find Egnir and ask him to return to Morlad.\n4\tTalk to Egnir\tEgnir can be found near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale. You have found Egnir, but he seems almost entirely focused on the Ruthless Dead and there is an anger behind his eyes. You should talk to Egnir.\n5\tCollect glimmering dust from the Ruthless Dead at Fennas Dûr (total: 12)\tGlimmering dust can be collected from the Ruthless Dead near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale. Egnir has asked you to collect glimmering dust from the Ruthless Dead.\n6\tDeliver the glimmering dust to Egnir\tEgnir can be found near Fennas Dûr, in the Blackroot Vale. You have collected a great deal of glimmering dust from the Ruthless Dead. You should deliver it to Egnir.\n",
[11972]="7004139B\n1\tA faint, candle-like flame gives way to the visage of a deathly specter. Unconcerned with the living, it voices echoes of the past, a corrupted memory of a long-ago wartime. Approach the strange apparitions.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have found all the battlefield memories in the Dead Marshes.\n",
[11973]="700586BF\n1\tBring the letter to Hunward at Trader's Wharf\tBrom Hawksbeard wrote to you, telling you to seek out a Rohirric Brawler by the name of Hunward. Hunward was seen heading for Trader's Wharf in the Wildwood.\n",
[11974]="70002E23\n1\tCollect trapdoor spider-fangs (total: 6)\030Collect flesh-gnawer spider-fangs (total: 6)\tTwo broods of spider make their home in the Wovenvales of the North Trollshaws, north of Thoroniel's camp. Thoroniel has asked you to collect fangs from the two different spider-broods in the North Trollshaws.\n",
[11975]="70034D7B\n1\tCollect and examine berries (total: 6)\tBerry bushes grow around the frozen ponds in the north-eastern Writhendowns. You should collect berries and examine them for signs of spoilage.\n2\tReturn to Thrymm with the berries you collected\tThrymm Red-beard is at his camp in the northern Writhendowns. You should return to Thrymm and show him the berries.\n",
[11976]="70061FCA\n1\tDefeat foes at Amon Firn (total: 14)\tCalargyl has asked you defeat foes at Amon Firn. Amon Firn is in north-eastern Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Calargyl\tYou should let Calargyl know that you have defeated foes at Amon Firn. Calargyl is near Amon Firn, in eastern Cardolan.\n",
[11977]="700582DC\n1\tSearch for Wyrmsgráf\tWyrmsgráf can be found somewhere in Elderslade. You should seek out Wyrmsgráf.\n2\tExamine the strange rock next to Wyrmsgráf\tWyrmsgráf can be found somewhere in Elderslade. You should examine the strange rock next to Wyrmsgráf.\n3\tTalk to Léothred at Wyrmsgráf\tLéothred can be found next to Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
[11978]="700453D9\n1\tDestroy trebuchets at Maudhúl Grak\tMaudhúl Grak is located in northern Taur Drúadan. You should destroy trebuchets at Maudhúl Grak.\n2\tDestroy trebuchets at Maudhúl Grak (total: 8)\tMaudhúl Grak is located in northern Taur Drúadan. You should destroy trebuchets at Maudhúl Grak.\n3\tCompleted\tThe trebuchets at Maudhúl Grak have been destroyed.\n",
[11979]="70044268\n1\tDefeat enemies at Pel Forod (total: 10)\030Defeat Chulûr\tPel Forod can be found in the northern section of Pelennor Fields. You should defeat enemies gathered on the destroyed farmlands.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[11980]="700621D2\n1\tTalk to Rhiangar\tMelynis has given the deciphered scroll to Rhiangar, who is waiting to speak with you. Rhiangar is among the circled caravans, in northern Cardolan.\n2\tRead the deciphered scroll\tRhiangar has suggested that you read the deciphered scroll which is on a bench next to her in the caravan south of Andrath. You should talk to Rhiangar when you are done.\n3\tTalk to Rhiangar\tRhiangar is waiting to speak with you among the circled caravans, in northern Cardolan.\n",
[11981]="70008B5A\n1\tTalk to Glóin\tGlóin is at his camp in the Misty Mountains, north of Rivendell. Lord Elrond asked you to warn Glóin of the threat rumoured to be growing within the walls of Helegrod.\n",
[11982]="7005463D\n1\tShalgoth fled into the deep-barrows of Gorthad Nûr. You should confront Shalgoth and stop the ritual.\t\n2\tTalk to Thurindol at Echad Uial\tThurindol can be found at Echad Uial in Rath Dúath. You should talk to Thurindol.\n",
[11983]="700413B7\n1\tEnter Nimrond cavern\tThe western entrance to Nimrond is located atop the mountain encampment of Dâr Matum. Enter the western side of the Nimrond caverns.\n2\tDefeat Ruthless Dead in Nimrond cavern (total: 2)\030Defeat Orcs in Nimrond cavern (total: 2)\030Search deeper into the caverns of Nimrond for Arvaethor\tArvaethor is located somewhere in the caverns of Nimrond. Search deeper into the caverns of Nimrond for Arvaethor.\n",
[11984]="7002D552\n1\tUse Öndótt's goat to travel north and speak with Thettmárr\tÖndótt's goat is beside Öndótt himself in the Old Silvertine City. You should use the goat to return to the Deep Descent with haste and speak with Thettmárr.\n",
[11985]="700173BE\n1\tDefeat the Orcs and trolls in the Grand Stair\030Complete the task involving the troll-handlers within the Grand Stair\tOssur is at the Orc-watch. Ossur has asked you to help him against the Orcs and trolls of the Grand Stair. Once satisfied, you will earn a portion of the respect needed to earn favour from Ossur to satisfy Avar and his task at watching the Grand Stair.\n2\tTalk to Ossur at the Orc-watch\tOssur is at the Orc-watch. You should return to Ossur and tell him that you completed the tasks focusing on the trolls of Moria.\n",
[11986]="700377A2\n1\tDefend the Deeping Wall\tSaruman's army has come to Helm's Deep. The wall must be held lest the fortress fall.\n",
[11987]="70037DD4\n1\tProtect the Dike\t\n",
[11988]="70037DD6\n1\tDefend the Deeping Wall\t\n",
[11989]="70037DD5\n1\tProtect the Dike\t\n",
[11990]="700377A5\n1\tHold the Deeping-coomb while the Rohirrim retreat into the Hornburg and Glittering Caves\t\n",
[11991]="70037DD8\n1\tProtect the Dike\t\n",
[11992]="70037DD7\n1\tProtect the Dike\t\n",
[11993]="70042FC2\n1\tHelp Dagor\030Help Indir\tDagor and Indir stand within the keep in Arnach. Help Dagor and Indir to make any last-minute preparations that are needed before the attack.\n2\tTalk to Baranor\tBaranor stands within the keep in Arnach. You have helped Dagor and Indir to prepare against the oncoming Haradrim attack. You should return to Baranor to let him know that all is ready.\n3\tTalk to Baranor\tBaranor stands before the keep in Arnach. Baranor waits to speak to you, now that the fighting is done.\n",
[11994]="7002F9A4\n1\tDefend Faldham with the help of the Elfward\tThane Elfmar awaits at the mead hall of Faldham. The Elfward of Faldham will have all of their abilities tested in defending their home.\n2\tSpeak to Thane Elfmar\tElfmar can be found at the mead hall of Faldham. Thane Elfmar wishes to discuss the outcome of the battle, and the future of Faldham.\n",
[11995]="70019BD1\n1\tTalk to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol to the north. You have been instructed to speak with Bahanneth, who will tell you how best you might aid the defenders there in thwarting the Orcs that foray out of Moria.\n",
[11996]="70029F55\n1\tTalk to Bron to defend Galtrev\tBron is at Galtrev. Talk to Bron to defend Galtrev.\n2\tTalk to Bron in Galtrev\tBron is in Galtrev at the milestone marker in the centre of town. You should speak with Bron to collect your reward for assisting in the defence of Galtrev.\n",
[11997]="7004E4C5\n1\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tGrámi Hornhelm can be found in Olin's Forge, in Hammerstead. You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.\n2\tHelp Lóssi with 'Withstanding the Marauders'\030Help Lóssi with 'The Head of the Snake'\030Help Lóssi with 'Relieving the Guard'\030Help Grámi Hornhelm with 'Weapon Repossession'\tThere is work to do in defence of Hammerstead. You should complete quests in Hammerstead.\n3\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tGrámi Hornhelm can be found in Hammerstead. You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.\n4\tTalk to the Easterling prisoner\tAn Easterling is being held prisoner in Hammerstead. You should talk to the Easterling prisoner.\n5\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tYou should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who can be found in Hammerstead.\n6\tReturn to Járnfast with Tuhâl\tLord Náin needs to know about the Jangovar threat. You should return to Járnfast with Tuhâl.\n7\tBring Tuhâl before Lord Náin\tLord Náin needs to know about the Jangovar threat. You should bring Tuhâl before Lord Náin in Járnfast.\n8\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl is preparing to stand before Lord Náin and speak his piece. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n",
[11998]="700097D8\n1\tTalk to Pantescal\tThe remains of House Brumbar are in Parth Aduial, north-east of Tinnudir. Naethmunn told you to cross the bridge to the mainland and then follow the shoreline north until you see the few walls that remain of House Brumbar. Naethmunn has asked you to lend your aid to Pantescal, currently planning the defence of an important Dúnedain site against a crowd of boggarts.\n2\tTalk to Naethmunn\tNaethmunn is at the Ranger camp on Tinnudir, in Evendim, south-west of House Brumbar. You defended House Brumbar from the band of boggarts that threatened it and should now return to Naethmunn with the tale of your success.\n",
[11999]="700440E2\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir when you are ready to begin\tMithrandir is standing near the baths of Minas Tirith. The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Mithrandir before the battle begins.\n2\tDefend the walls of Minas Tirith from the Enemy\tThe Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You must hold against the Enemy's forces.\n3\tThe battle is not over. You should await Mithrandir and Imrahil's command.\t\n",
[12000]="700442C8\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir when you are ready to begin\tMithrandir is standing near the baths of Minas Tirith. The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Mithrandir before the battle begins.\n2\tDefend the walls of Minas Tirith from the Enemy\tThe Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You must hold against the Enemy's forces.\n3\tThe battle is not over. You should await Mithrandir and Imrahil's command.\t\n",
